        "fun": "A living lump of coal that rolls about on one wheel-like leg. Rolycoly was discovered in coal mines about 400 years ago, and until about a century ago every home in Galar kept one, burning the coal it sheds for cooking and heating. Dwebble sometimes mistake it for a rock to move into.",
        "guide": "A Rock-type Pokémon made mostly of coal, first found in Galar's coal mines about 400 years ago. Rolycoly rolls around like a unicycle, and the coal it sheds once heated Galar's homes. It evolves into Carkol and then Coalossal.",
