        "fun": "A minecart that makes its own coal. Coal tar inside Carkol keeps the heap on its back from falling apart even when it races along at over 30 km/h, and the coal it drops once fuelled everyday life in Galar. When it feels strong emotions its insides heat up, and it rolls around frantically spewing flames.",
