      "description": {
        "fun": "A gentle giant made of coal, until someone vandalises its mine: then it incinerates the culprits with flames of about 1,500 °C. Its dinosaur-like look may play on the myth that fossil fuels come from dinosaurs, and its skin grows smoother as it evolves, perhaps like rock changed by heat and pressure.",
        "guide": "The final evolution of Rolycoly, a towering coal Pokémon that is usually peaceful but fiercely protects the mines where it lives. Its body can burn at about 1,500 °C. It has a Gigantamax form.",
        "tagline": "A peaceful coal giant that burns mine vandals to ash",
